## Rows skipped (6)

- hi-a 1 P1 003 sentencing. Not applied. RULEBOOK R3 and ACCEPTED-ROUND forbid turning the softened “some judgments / not a guaranteed outcome” line back into “courts generally impose about 3 / 4 / 6 months”. Digits 3, 4, and 6 stay.
- hi-a 2 P1 004 article number. Not applied. The reviewer is right that the URL flno=3 is Article 3 of 各類所得扣繳率標準, and the statute name is already that standard. The Korean source label is still 영업세법 제10조. The checker strips URLs and counts 제10조 as 10, so replacing the visible 10 with 3 fails as a missing 10. ACCEPTED-ROUND: do not change numbers when the checker cannot accept the new form.
- hi-a 4 P2 copyright gloss 著作權. Applied, then reverted. guidance-disclosure-parity.test.ts requires the same CJK gloss set as Vietnamese on each guidance page. 著作權 is not in that pivot set (German has no 著作權 either). A Hindi-only gloss fails the test. This lane cannot edit the other locales. Sister locales outside that test (ne, bn, ur, ta, my) already gloss it.
- hi-a 6 P2 and hi-b 4 P2 lakh/crore grouping (15,70,000 and the listed TWD/USD amounts, including the team-bio TWD 1,570,000). Not applied. ACCEPTED-ROUND skips lakh grouping because the checker cannot parse it. Hindi number style in the checker is Western comma grouping. TWD 1.57M was not in these rows and stays byte-identical.
- hi-a 8 P2 003 “अधिकतम क्षतिपूर्ति”. Not applied. R3 already replaced “pursue the maximum compensation” with compensation the facts and evidence support. Restoring अधिकतम is a result claim.

No P3 rows in either review.

