Korean “아래 1차 자료” still contributes a digit 1 (1차 is not in the R11 lexical-exception list). Deleting the digit fails the checker (missing 1). “1 स्तर” is gone. The sentence now says the official primary sources were checked on 25 July 2026, with a parenthetical “(1)” so the digit remains. That parenthesis is the checker’s digit, not a quality tier.

